### Test 21: Check-in thiếu deviceAuth (Expect: 422 AUTHENTICATION_FAILED khi policy=always)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{emp01Token}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{emp01Fingerprint}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TestBoundary

